{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764460/extras/1b2286feba6499f58b949f563f27696a.avif?t=1755484753\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark December</strong> unfolds in the prequel universe of Undecember, set in a turbulent era where remnants of ancient civilizations clash with mythic powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the player, you will uncover the forgotten truth of a fallen hero, confronting powerful factions across a battlefield consumed by chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an epic tale where myth and destiny intertwine brought to life through immersive storytelling and intense action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of DarkDecember</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master strategic party-based raids, harness class-specific rune systems, and customize your gear through the power of Aether Cores \u2014 all to forge a character stronger than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>DarkDecember</strong>, weapons are more than just steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They evolve with your will, becoming a force capable of reshaping the battlefield itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Campaign and Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your character through strategic party-based raids, class-specific rune systems, and item customization powered by Aether Cores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In DarkDecember, weapons are more than mere steel they evolve with the player\u2019s will, becoming a force capable of reshaping the tide of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your limits in the <strong>Corridor of Oblivion</strong> and the <strong>Dimensional Rift</strong>.<br>The Corridor of Oblivion is a place where forgotten memories and present nightmares collide where fallen bosses rise once more, stronger than ever, to challenge you again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Dimensional Rift, you must join forces with your allies to fend off waves of enemies seeking to resurrect the sealed <strong>Valknut</strong>.<br>Stand your ground against the oncoming darkness and protect a crumbling world.<br>The hero who can turn the tide of fate is you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764460?t=1755484753","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764460/e2a47f4ca80baa2fc8e6e4cb8e6956ecda13fb8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755484753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764460/84ca8c03bff0d9fc3369ecaf7f748bae17512a66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755484753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764460/84ca8c03bff0d9fc3369ecaf7f748bae17512a66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755484753","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"\uc774 \uac8c\uc784\uc5d0\ub294 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc5f0\ub839\uc5d0 \uc801\ud569\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc740 \ucf58\ud150\uce20 \ub610\ub294 \uc9c1\uc7a5\uc5d0\uc11c \uc774\uc6a9\ud558\uae30\uc5d0 \ubd80\uc801\uc808\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \ucf58\ud150\uce20\uac00 \ud3ec\ud568\ub418\uc5b4 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4: \uc7a6\uc740 \ud3ed\ub825 \ub610\ub294 \uc720\ud608, \uc218\uc704 \ub192\uc740 \ucf58\ud150\uce20\r\n\r\n\uac8c\uc784\ub0b4 \ub178\ucd9c\uc774 \uc2ec\ud55c \ucf54\uc2a4\ud2ac\uacfc \uc218\uc601\ubcf5\uc774 \ud3ec\ud568\ub418\uc5b4 \uc788\uc73c\uba70 \uc804\ud22c\uc2dc \ud3ed\ub825\uc801\uc778 \uc804\ud22c\uc7a5\uba74\uacfc \ud53c \ud280\uae30\ub294 \ud6a8\uacfc\uac00 \ud3ec\ud568\ub418\uc5b4 \uc788\uc74c"},"detai